\f0\fs36 \cf11 {\listtext	10.	}Alternatives considered\
\pard\pardeftab720\ri-6\sl276\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\fs28 \cf11 {\listtext	11.	}Option: Upgrade\
\pard\pardeftab720\ri-6\sl276\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2\fs22 \cf7 {\listtext	12.	}This option ensures that OICv1 will remain online in some capacity while GDCag core is being rebootstrapped, however was determined to be infeasible due to the exceptional amount manual work and toil required to cover the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "%5Cl%20%22h.ja295f4elq8z%22"}}{\fldrslt \cf6 \ul \ulc6 1.16.2 Requirements}}\cf6  along side of extra time to return the environment from staleness to a pristine state.\cf0 \
